  "etymology_text": "Inherited from Ancient Greek διαλέγω (dialégō), from δια- (dia-) + λέγω (légo) (sense \"choose\" of ancient λέγω (légō)).\nFor the passive voice sense \"discuss\", a learned internal borrowing from Ancient Greek διαλέγομαι (dialégomai) (sense \"say, tell\" of ancient λέγω (légō))",
